   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ECAM：配置空间怎么访问",
   "originalText": "ECAM：配置空间怎么访问",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "name": "ecam_h"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "4IZySAEk",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2196,
   "y": 1980,
   "width": 571.1999999999996,
   "height": 157.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0188",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1188,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8319,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "现代平台把所有功能的配置空间平铺到一段物理地址里：\n地址 = ECAM 基址 + 总线号 << 20 | 设备号 << 15 | 功能号 << 12 | 寄存器偏移\n每个功能正好 4KB。\n\n例：03:00.0 的 Command 寄存器\n= 基址 + 0x0300000 + 0x04\n\n内核里：drivers/pci/ecam.c；用户态可读\n/sys/bus/pci/devices/<BDF>/config",
   "originalText": "现代平台把所有功能的配置空间平铺到一段物理地址里：\n地址 = ECAM 基址 + 总线号 << 20 | 设备号 << 15 | 功能号 << 12 | 寄存器偏移\n每个功能正好 4KB。\n\n例：03:00.0 的 Command 寄存器\n= 基址 + 0x0300000 + 0x04\n\n内核里：drivers/pci/ecam.c；用户态可读\n/sys/bus/pci/devices/<BDF>/config",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "name": "ecam_b"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "1Z5Cp9Ij",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 2180,
   "y": 2266,
   "width": 1420,
   "height": 120.6,
