   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BAR 是怎么变成地址的",
   "originalText": "BAR 是怎么变成地址的",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "name": "bar_h"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "rOfodDBn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2196,
   "y": 2310,
   "width": 492.79999999999995,
   "height": 52.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0191",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1191,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8340,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. 软件往 BAR 写全 1，再读回来 → 得知设备要多大的窗口（比如 16KB）\n2. 枚举时在地址空间里给它分一块，写回 BAR\n3. 之后 CPU 读写这块地址，RC 就生成 TLP 送到这个设备（MMIO）",
   "originalText": "1. 软件往 BAR 写全 1，再读回来 → 得知设备要多大的窗口（比如 16KB）\n2. 枚举时在地址空间里给它分一块，写回 BAR\n3. 之后 CPU 读写这块地址，RC 就生成 TLP 送到这个设备（MMIO）",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "name": "bar_b"
   }
  },
