  {
   "id": "WJBnMSwK",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2116,
   "y": 2544.6,
   "width": 375.2,
   "height": 192.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0231",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1231,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8620,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "一次 DMA 写的 TLP（示意，字段按规范简化）\n\n头部\n  类型      = MWr（64 位地址）\n  Length    = 16 DW（64 字节数据）\n  Requester = 03:00.0      ← 我是谁（NVMe 盘）\n  Tag       = 0x1a\n  Address   = 0x0000_0008_1234_5000\n数据\n  64 字节 ……\n链路层再加：序号 + LCRC",
   "originalText": "一次 DMA 写的 TLP（示意，字段按规范简化）\n\n头部\n  类型      = MWr（64 位地址）\n  Length    = 16 DW（64 字节数据）\n  Requester = 03:00.0      ← 我是谁（NVMe 盘）\n  Tag       = 0x1a\n  Address   = 0x0000_0008_1234_5000\n数据\n  64 字节 ……\n链路层再加：序号 + LCRC",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "name": "tlp_ex_t"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "zdEEqPfc",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2795.599999999999,
   "width": 926.7999999999996,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0232",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1232,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 8627,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "路由方式：内存类 TLP 按地址路由（交换机看每个下行口桥的地址窗口）；配置类按 BDF 路由；完成包按 Requester ID 路由回去。\n顺序规则（简化）：同一路径上，后发的写不会越过先发的写 —— 所以设备先 DMA 写数据、再发 MSI，CPU 收到中断时，数据一定已经在内存里。",
   "originalText": "路由方式：内存类 TLP 按地址路由（交换机看每个下行口桥的地址窗口）；配置类按 BDF 路由；完成包按 Requester ID 路由回去。\n顺序规则（简化）：同一路径上，后发的写不会越过先发的写 —— 所以设备先 DMA 写数据、再发 MSI，CPU 收到中断时，数据一定已经在内存里。",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "name": "tlp_route"
   }
  },
